# SLO Ground Truth V1 is a versioned ASSET and must be tracked.
# It contains file paths and labels -- metadata, never audio.
!tools/classification_benchmark/ground_truth/
!tools/classification_benchmark/ground_truth/**

# By-ear label CSVs are PRODUCT-CRITICAL GROUND TRUTH. They contain file paths
# and labels -- metadata, never audio -- so tracking them distributes no
# licensed content, and losing them costs owner time that cannot be recovered.
# The blanket verified_*.csv ignore stays for scratch files; these four are
# explicitly un-ignored.
!tools/classification_benchmark/verified_drums.csv
!tools/classification_benchmark/verified_domain_coverage.csv
!tools/classification_benchmark/verified_percussion_subtype.csv
!tools/classification_benchmark/verified_percussion_corrections.csv
!tools/classification_benchmark/verified_bass.csv
